        "lede": "Virtual staging is a digital marketing technique for real estate photos: an interior designer adds 3D furniture and decor to empty or cleared rooms so buyers can see how the space lives, with no furniture ever entering the house. Bella's designers stage Atlanta listings in 24 to 48 hours, from {price:virtual-staging} a photo — renovations rendered too.",
