            "answer": "Physical home staging is priced by the stager, the size of the house and how long the furniture stays, so Atlanta quotes vary; as a general benchmark, conventional staging runs about $2,000–5,000 a month until the home sells. Virtual staging from Bella is {price:virtual-staging} a photo, paid once, with no rental period to extend if the listing sits."
