        "q7": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is virtual staging worth it?",
            "answer": "For most vacant homes, yes. Staging can't guarantee a sale, but 97% of buyers start their search online, and 82% of buyers' agents say staging makes it easier for buyers to visualize a property as their future home, according to the National Association of Realtors. Virtual staging gives the listing photos that effect for a one-time cost per photo instead of monthly furniture rental."
